<properties>
{"title":"SMS Templates"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="💬" color="gray_bg">
	Text like a human, not a broadcast. Short, lowercase-casual, one idea. Speed beats polish. Never quote a price, never promise a result, never say ban-proof / guaranteed.
</callout>
## Speed-to-lead (no answer on first call)
"hey \[Name\], it's \[You\] with The Grid, just tried you, you applied to get the system set up. got 2 min for a quick call so I can see if it's a fit?"
## Second attempt (still no answer, same day)
"\[Name\] didn't catch you, no worries. when's better today, i'll call you then? this is the one where we map the whole thing to your setup."
## Booked confirmation
"locked you in with \[Closer\] for \[day/time\]. you'll get a calendar invite. do me a favor and actually show up on time, they block that slot just for you. anything comes up, text me."
## No-show (see the No-Show Process for the full cadence)
"hey \[Name\], we were set for right now, everything good? i got you, want me to grab the next open slot today? here's the link: [mbemultiaccounting.com/apply](http://mbemultiaccounting.com/apply)"
## Reschedule
"all good, life happens. i've got \[option 1\] or \[option 2\], which works and i'll move you right now."
<callout icon="🔗" color="blue_bg">
	Send prospects to the funnel ([mbemultiaccounting.com/apply](https://mbemultiaccounting.com/apply)) and the community ([discord.gg/mbe](https://discord.gg/mbe)). Log every text in Close. Always text from the team's registered sending number.
</callout>
</content>
